## Practical recommendation for your setup

Given you trust yourself but want defense in depth, here’s a balanced config:

```ts
const { session } = await createAgentSession({
  cwd: projectRoot,
  modelRuntime,
  sessionManager: SessionManager.inMemory(),

  // Hard allowlist: only expose tools you’re comfortable with
  tools: ["read", "bash", "edit", "write", "grep", "find", "ls"],

  // Load a permission-gate extension
  resourceLoader: new DefaultResourceLoader({
    cwd: projectRoot,
    additionalExtensionPaths: ["./server/pi-extensions/permission-gate.ts"],
